SUMMARY:Club Chaos: Sonic 35th Celebration
DESCRIPTION:SEGA will host the Club Chaos: Sonic 35th Celebration live stream on October 9 at 4:30 p.m. PT / 7:30 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe description reads\, “The portal to Club Chaos will open for a one night only immersive experience celebrating 35 years of Sonic! Tune into the live stream as host Jacki Jing takes viewers through the event featuring special performances from musical guests Thundercat\, Austin Millz\, and Tee Lopes\, conversations with Sonic talent and creators\, as well as sneak peeks and special announcements.”
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/club-chaos-sonic-35th-celebration
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Club-Chaos-Inits_10-09-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
